OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry and
OL,6,Foften clear this evening and chilly
OL,7,Fwith a touch of frost in places. Cloud
OL,8,Fcould increase overnight with the odd
OL,9,Fshower, mainly Moray and northern
OL,10,FAberdeenshire.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FRather cloudy at times with
OL,13,Fbright spells and the occasional
OL,14,Fshower. Winds will be light to
OL,15,Fmoderate from the northwest.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRather
OL,18,Fcloudy at times with bright spells and
OL,19,Fthe occasional showers. Winds will be
OL,20,Flight from the northeast.
